From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:19:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gateway): keep the listener up through a restart stop
 until the profile is released

gateway.restart_listener_handover (false = off): on a restart stop the gateway listener stays bound. GET /api/health answers 200 and the restart wait's reads work until the stores close, then health alone until the profile lock and host role are released; only then does the listener close. Sockets and writes are refused from the start of the stop as before. A standby's readiness then takes over from this one's without the gap of the old gateway's whole teardown.
