+Once the wait ends the gateway closes its listener, so a readiness probe on it
+fails for the whole shutdown and the successor's boot. Set
+`gateway.restart_listener_handover: true` to keep the listener bound on a
+restart until the gateway releases the profile: `GET /api/health` answers 200
+throughout, and the reads a client needs to find its chats keep working until
+the stores close. Sockets and writes are refused from the start of the stop as
